# Zooms the map view in with the wheel and a key, then pans it with a key and a drag.
# Run it as the README's "Run a play script" shows: --map --play play/zoom-pan.play.
# Each shot comes after a wait, because a step takes effect in the frame after it.
wait 0.3
expect zoom = 1
dump start
shot start

# Three wheel notches and the plus key: 1.25 to the fourth power.
scroll up 3
press Plus
wait 0.2
expect zoom = 2.4414
dump zoomed
shot zoomed

# The right arrow key moves the view east and the down arrow key south, at the zoom's screen speed.
hold Right 0.5
hold Down 0.5
wait 0.2
dump panned
shot panned

# A drag moves the map with the mouse.
drag 600 300 400 200
wait 0.2
dump dragged
shot dragged
